{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PHrd62MBPjQgcKzjDRczhZ","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-21\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **register_pilot** (negative): Register axis (academic/conversational) RATE counterfactuals preserve content (NLI+BERTScore pass rate ≥80%) and register is independent from formality (agreement ≤95%), making it a viable third axis alongside formality and verbosity\\\\n- **exp014_logistic_decomposition** (success): The observed 69.1% formal win rate in pairwise comparison is primarily driven by original-preference bias rather than genuine formality effect, and logistic regression decomposition will show formality coefficient is non-significant after controlling for original preference\\\\n- **exp012_consistency_bias** (success): The consistency filter (discarding 43% of pairs) introduces systematic selection bias by preferentially retaining pairs with higher NLI/BERTScore or different text characteristics, biasing downstream analysis\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 5 / 负向 5 / 失败 0 / 共 10\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestb-29275: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1042, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01H5X9GAUEw6oPgskzJAS1VF","session_id":"e6e97501-db33-49e4-82d6-a111de115694","uuid":"d327351b-1c5e-4125-a082-f48619f617e6","timestamp":"2026-05-21T00:19:47.731Z"}
